{"id":63594,"date":"2026-08-25T19:19:28","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T18:19:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63594"},"modified":"2026-08-27T00:21:01","modified_gmt":"2026-08-26T23:21:01","slug":"deka-lisboa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/deka-lisboa\/","title":{"rendered":"Deka Lisboa 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\",\n      \"name\": \"Deka Lisboa 2027\",\n      \"startDate\": \"2026-10-18T09:00:00+00:00\",\n      \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Avenida Marginal (Alg\u00e9s a Carcavelos)\",\n        \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Oeiras\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"description\": \"A Corrida do Tejo 2026 \u00e9 a m\u00edtica prova de 10 km disputada na Avenida Marginal entre Alg\u00e9s e a Praia de Carcavelos, em Oeiras.\",\n      \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/deka-lisboa\/\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida do Tejo 2026?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no outono de 2026 na Avenida Marginal de Oeiras, com partida em Alg\u00e9s e meta na Praia de Carcavelos.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia da corrida?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"A Corrida do Tejo tem a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de 10 km em asfalto plano ao longo da costa de Oeiras.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n<\/script><\/p>\n<style>\n.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }\n.pr-calc-event-banner { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important; border-radius: 16px !important; padding: 18px 22px !important; margin: 24px 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: space-between !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important; gap: 14px !important; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important; }\n.pr-calc-event-header { display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 4px !important; }\n.pr-calc-event-title { color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 15px !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }\n.pr-calc-event-desc { color: #94A3B8 !important; font-size: 13px !important; display: block !important; }\n.pr-calc-event-btn { display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important; color: #C4B5FD !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-size: 13px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; padding: 10px 20px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; text-decoration: none !important; }\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); color: #C4B5FD; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    \ud83d\udcc5 Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Confirmada 2026\n  <\/div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Deka Lisboa 2027<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n    A <strong>Deka Lisboa 2027<\/strong> \u00e9 a m\u00edtica e hist\u00f3rica corrida de 10 km que liga Alg\u00e9s \u00e0 Praia de Carcavelos ao longo da magn\u00edfica Avenida Marginal de Oeiras. Organizada pelo Munic\u00edpio de Oeiras, a prova \u00e9 um dos maiores s\u00edmbolos do atletismo de estrada nacional, reunindo mais de 10.000 corredores num ambiente festivo inigual\u00e1vel junto ao mar.\n  <\/p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Disputada num percurso em reta longa de asfalto plano com vistas deslumbrantes sobre o Rio Tejo e o Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico, a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de <strong>10 km<\/strong> atrai tanto atletas de topo como populares de todas as idades. Planeia a tua estrat\u00e9gia com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre as melhores provas no nosso <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/melhores-corridas-10k\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">guia de corridas 10k em Portugal<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">\/ Snapshot<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data &amp; Hor\u00e1rio:<\/strong> <span style=\"word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Outubro de 2026 | 10h00 (Partida)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udccd Partida &amp; Chegada:<\/strong> <span style=\"word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Alg\u00e9s (Partida) \/ Praia de Carcavelos (Chegada), Oeiras<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span style=\"word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">10 km (Prova Principal em Estrada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udcb6 Tarifas Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong> <span style=\"word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Consulte os lotes de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na plataforma oficial<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso &amp; Relevo:<\/strong> <span style=\"word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Asfalto urbano plano na Av. Marginal (N6)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83c\udf92 Secretariado\/Kit:<\/strong> <span style=\"word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Complexo Desportivo do Jamor \/ Oeiras nos dias anteriores<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Prova &amp; Percurso<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    O percurso da <strong>Corrida do Tejo<\/strong> \u00e9 inteiramente desenhado no sentido Leste-Oeste da Avenida Marginal (N6). Partindo da zona de Alg\u00e9s, os atletas cumprem 10 km cont\u00ednuos em paralelo com o mar, passando por Cruz Quebrada, Caxias, Pa\u00e7o de Arcos e Santo Amaro de Oeiras at\u00e9 \u00e0 grande meta instalada na c\u00e9lebre Praia de Carcavelos. O tra\u00e7ado em reta com suave oscila\u00e7\u00e3o permite excelente ritmo de corrida. Para escolher as sapatilhas mais adequadas, consulte o nosso <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/como-escolher-sapatilhas-corrida\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">guia de sapatilhas de corrida<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border-left: 3px solid #8B5CF6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-top: 14px;\">\n    <strong style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Clima &amp; Condi\u00e7\u00f5es Previstas da \u00c9poca:<\/strong><br \/>\n    <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6;\">No outono na costa de Oeiras, as manh\u00e3s s\u00e3o amenas e agrad\u00e1veis, com temperaturas entre os <strong>15\u00b0C e 19\u00b0C<\/strong>. Recomenda-se t-shirt t\u00e9cnica leve e aten\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 dire\u00e7\u00e3o da brisa mar\u00edtima na Marginal.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span><br \/>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr a Corrida do Tejo com um objetivo de tempo nos 10 km?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n<p>    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de ritmo e tempo final na nossa calculadora interativa de pace.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n<p>  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ficar (Oeiras \/ Carcavelos)<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Para quem se desloca a Oeiras, recomendam-se hot\u00e9is e alojamentos na linha de comboio de Cascais (Carcavelos, Pa\u00e7o de Arcos, Oeiras ou Alg\u00e9s), facilitando a desloca\u00e7\u00e3o de comboio at\u00e9 \u00e0 partida em Alg\u00e9s e o regresso ap\u00f3s a meta em Carcavelos.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre Oeiras &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia Mar\u00edtima<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    Oeiras \u00e9 um dos concelhos de maior tradi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva de Portugal. Ap\u00f3s cortar a linha de meta na Praia de Carcavelos, a festa prossegue nas esplanadas junto \u00e0 praia e nos restaurantes de marisco e peixe fresco de Pa\u00e7o de Arcos e Santo Amaro.\n  <\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border-left: 3px solid #C4B5FD; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-top: 14px;\">\n    <strong style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &amp; Espectadores:<\/strong><br \/>\n    <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6;\">Os melhores locais para a fam\u00edlia assistir \u00e0 passagem dos atletas s\u00e3o o <strong>Passeio Mar\u00edtimo de Oeiras<\/strong> em Pa\u00e7o de Arcos e o extenso areal da <strong>Praia de Carcavelos<\/strong> na linha de chegada.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.18); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfc3 Outras Provas em <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Oeiras &amp; Lisboa<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Procuras outros desafios na linha de Cascais ou no Distrito de Lisboa? Explora as nossas recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es:\n  <\/p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <span style=\"color: #C4B5FD;\">\ud83d\udc49<\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lynxrace-oeiras\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">Lynxrace Oeiras (Jamor)<\/a>\n    <\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <span style=\"color: #C4B5FD;\">\ud83d\udc49<\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/running-in-lisbon\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">Guia Completo: Running in Lisbon &amp; Corridas na Regi\u00e3o<\/a>\n    <\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-faq-section\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    \u2753 Perguntas Frequentes (<span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">FAQ<\/span>)<br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Corrida do Tejo 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">A prova realiza-se no outono de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 10h00 em Alg\u00e9s.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 levantado o kit de participante e dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O levantamento do kit e t-shirt oficial decorre no Complexo Desportivo do Jamor nos dias que antecedem o evento mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do comprovativo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tipos de percurso e dist\u00e2ncias?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O evento conta com a dist\u00e2ncia \u00fanica de 10 km em asfalto plano ao longo da Avenida Marginal de Oeiras.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\">Onde ser\u00e3o disponibilizados os resultados e fotos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">Os resultados oficiais, tempos e fotorreportagem da prova ser\u00e3o publicados no portal Portugal Running e na plataforma oficial ap\u00f3s o evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\">Existem balne\u00e1rios e abastecimentos no percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 5 km e na chegada em Carcavelos, bem como suporte m\u00e9dico e transporte de sacos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":63595,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,1455,519],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63594","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-hyrox","event_type-obstaculos","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/images-4.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63594","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":